      "title": "Excess Tower \u2014 Convex Policy Number Documentation Defect",
      "subject": "",
      "content": "[Ugly] Excess Tower \u2014 Convex Policy Number Documentation Defect\nRisk Score: 10/25\n\nWhat this means:\nYour $5 million excess policy and your $5 million primary policy don't agree on the policy number they're built around. This is a documentation defect that could let your excess carrier walk away from a $5M-$10M claim. It's almost certainly a typo \u2014 but in insurance, typos in policy numbers are not\n\nRecommendation:\nImmediately email RSG Specialty and Convex requesting a corrected Schedule of Underlying Insurance endorsement reflecting the actual primary policy number. Get written confirmation from both Gemini an",
